 v80.0 improvements [2026-06-12]:
   1. G8.5J HMM VOLATILITY REGIME TRANSITION GATE (45th gate, ±2.0/+1.5pts): New soft-gate that
      reads `hmm_expansion_prob` already injected at F79 and compares it against a per-symbol
      EWMA baseline to compute a regime-velocity delta. When HMM expansion probability is
      diverging AGAINST the trade direction (i.e. LONG but P_expansion dropping fast, or SHORT
      but P_expansion rising fast → regime is transitioning adversely) → −2.0pts penalty.
      When expansion prob is STRONGLY ALIGNED with direction AND above 0.65 threshold →
      +1.5pts bonus. When neutral or missing → 0pts. Uses per-symbol ring `_g85j_hmm_ewma`
      (EWMA α=0.30). Zero-API-call gate — reads in-cycle signal_data hmm_expansion_prob.
      Wired to gate_stats/_GATE_DISPLAY_LABELS/_SOFT_GATE_KEYS/_record() [v78.0].
   2. KELLY STEP 37: HMM REGIME TRANSITION DAMPENER: Uses G8.5J result stored in
      `_last_g85j_regime_signal` (+1=aligned expansion, -1=adverse transition, 0=neutral).
      When adverse HMM transition detected (regime moving against direction) → Kelly ×0.87
      (extra de-size: regime transition into adversity is a confirmed position-quality degrader).
      When strong HMM alignment → Kelly ×1.04. Stacks AFTER Step 36; non-fatal [v78.0].
   3. BOOT DROUGHT SUPPRESSION FIX: `_last_outcome_ts = now - 1800s` pre-ageing on warm-start
      was immediately triggering drought base-cuts on EVERY restart (staleness=1800s >
      2×_decay_start at first _update_threshold_rl() call). Fix: suppress drought base-cuts
      for the first 300s (5 min) after boot by checking `time.time() - self._session_start_time
      < 300.0` at the start of the drought cut block. Starvation decay (helpful for break-
      out of threshold lock) is NOT suppressed — only the base-% reduction is gated. This
      prevents the boot-cycle pattern: restart → drought cut fires → threshold lowered 3-6pts
      → borderline-quality signals pass immediately at sub-optimal conditions [v78.0].
   4. SCAN_PARALLEL_LIMIT 76→78 (+2.6% throughput): Stays within Binance rate envelope via
      0.5s batch stagger guard already in place [v78.0].
   5. KEY GATES HEADER UPDATE → v78.0. 44-gate → 45-gate filter. Kelly 36-steps → 37-steps.
      ScanParallel76 → ScanParallel78. All banners, capability stamps, and architecture logs
      updated to reflect 45-gate filter and Kelly Steps 1-37 [v78.0].
 v77.0 improvements [2026-06-12]:
   1. G8.5H BID-ASK FLOW ASYMMETRY GATE (43rd gate, ±2.0/+1.5pts): New soft-gate measuring
      cross-signal coherence between OFI z-score direction and orderbook imbalance. When OFI
      |z| > 1.5 AND orderbook imbalance BOTH oppose the trade direction simultaneously
      (dual-source adverse selection signal) → -2.0pts. OFI |z| > 1.0 opposed alone → -1.0pts.
      OFI |z| > 1.0 aligned AND OB imbalance aligned → +1.5pts (dual-source momentum confirm).
      Sources: `_timing_state.ofi_zscore(symbol)` and `signal_data["ob_imbalance"]` (already
      injected at F85). Zero-API-call gate — reads in-cycle state. Stores
      `_last_g85h_ofi_aligned` for Kelly Step 36. Wired to gate_stats/_GATE_DISPLAY_LABELS/
      _SOFT_GATE_KEYS/_record() [v77.0].
   2. G8.5I CLOSE-MICROTREND SLOPE GATE (44th gate, ±1.5pts): New soft-gate using the
      module-level `_quant_layer_close_buf[symbol]` (rolling 60-bar close buffer already
      populated by the kline WS feed every minute). Computes linear regression slope over the
      last 10 closes via numpy polyfit. When slope direction is ALIGNED with the trade
      direction → +1.5pts (short-term price momentum confirms signal). When slope is OPPOSED
      → -1.5pts (price micro-trend is fighting the signal direction). Guard: requires ≥ 5
      closes in buffer (cold-start safe). Zero-API-call gate — reads existing buffer.
      Wired to gate_stats/_GATE_DISPLAY_LABELS/_SOFT_GATE_KEYS/_record() [v77.0].
   3. KELLY STEP 36: OFI-FLOW ASYMMETRY SIZING: When G8.5H detects strong dual-source adverse
      selection (OFI |z| > 1.5 + OB imbalance both opposed) → Kelly ×0.83 (de-size: two
      independent flow signals confirm unfavorable entry conditions). When G8.5H detects
      strong dual-source alignment (OFI + OB imbalance both aligned, z > 1.5) → Kelly ×1.03
      (amplify: two independent real-time flow signals confirm strong directional momentum).
      Uses `_last_g85h_ofi_aligned` stored by G8.5H gate. Stacks AFTER Step 35; non-fatal [v77.0].
   4. NN v15 — INPUT_DIM 85→90 (+5 flow/microtrend features): F86=ofi_flow_asym_norm
      (ofi_z × ob_imbalance_centered cross-product, clipped ±1; flow asymmetry tensor);
      F87=microtrend_slope_norm (10-close linear slope / (median_close×0.001), clipped ±1;
