        # Vote 2: _last_g85s2_wrcrisis   — WinRate-CrisisRegime (+1=WR-stabilising, -1=WR-crisis, 0=neutral)
        # Vote 3: _last_g85z2_rms        — RegimeMomentumSync (+1=3/3 or 2/3 aligned, -1=opposed, 0=neutral)
        #   +2.0pts = 3-vote positive (all 3 regime-quality sources confirm regime support)
        #   +1.5pts = 2-vote majority positive (majority of regime-quality sources aligned)
        #   −1.5pts = 2-vote majority negative (majority of regime-quality sources opposed)
        #   −2.0pts = 3-vote negative (all 3 regime-quality sources confirm regime opposition)
        # Stores _last_g85z3_rqt (+1/-1/0) for Kelly Step 78 [v114.0].
        try:
