        # ── v85.0 Kelly Step 45: WinRate-CrisisRegime Sizing ─────────────────
        # G8.5S2 result: +1=healthy/strong WR regime → Kelly ×1.03 (mild boost).
        # G8.5S2 result: -1=ultra-crisis WR (<28%) → Kelly ×0.86 (de-size aggressively).
        # 0=neutral → no change.
